\cp 153
\p
\v 1 \vp 92\vp* To say: Osiris N., open thy mouth with it.
\q1 Utterances 153-155.
\q1 End of 153.
\q1 To say four times: For N., a lifting up of the offering, four times. Two jars of wine of the North. Wine: Two bowls of the North; two jars of ‘bš; two bowls of Buto; two bowls of (wine) Of ḥȝmw; two bowls of Pelusium.
