\q1 End of 155.
\q1 To say four times: For N., a lifting up of the offering, four times. Two jars of wine of Buto.
\c 201
\cp 156
\p
\v 1 \vp 93\vp* To say: Osiris N., take to thyself the eye of Horus, which he fished up. Open thy mouth with it.
\q1 To say four times: For N., a lifting up of the offering, four times. Two jars of wine of ḥȝmw.
\c 202
\cp 157
\p
\v 1 \vp 94\vp* To say: Osiris N., take to thyself the eye of Horus. It shall not again be separated from thee.
\q1 To say four times: For N., a lifting up of the offering, four times. Two jars of wine of Pelusium.
