\cp 159
\p
\v 1 \vp 95\vp* To say: Osiris N., take to thyself the eye of Horus, which he carried about with him (?), (or, which he swallowed?).
\q1 To say four times: For N., a lifting up of the offering, four times. Two baskets of ḫnfw-cakes (fruit ?).
\c 205
\cp 160
\p
\v 1 \vp 95\vp* To say: Osiris N., take to thyself the eye of Horus, which he took from Set.
